.TH ZENITH.CONF 5 "October 2026" "Zenith 1.5.0" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
zenith.conf \- Configuration file for the Zenith Gaming Optimization Daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fI/etc/zenith/zenith.conf\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fIzenith.conf\fR is an INI-style plain text configuration file read by \fBzenith\fR(8) at startup. Empty lines and lines beginning with '#' or ';' are ignored as comments. Inline comments following values are supported.
.PP
The configuration file enforces strict validation: unknown keys, invalid types, or out-of-range integer values result in startup failure to prevent configuration drift.
.SH SETTINGS
.TP
.BR version " = \fISTRING\fR"
Configuration schema version (default: \fB1.1.0\fR).
.TP
.BR profile " = \fIPROFILE\fR" (alias: \fBactive_profile\fR)
Default profile activated during game sessions. Permitted values:
.RS
.IP \fBsafe\fR
Zero-risk optimizations only. No sysctl alterations, no GPU clock locks, conservative cgroups.
.IP \fBbalanced\fR
Default profile. Enables V-Cache/P-core pinning, mild VM tuning, and cgroups v2 background isolation.
.IP \fBaggressive\fR
Maximum performance. Enables split-lock disablement, GPU clock lock, real-time audio priority, and CAKE network queueing.
.IP \fBultra\fR
Hardcore competitive mode. Automatically freezes background processes (cgroup.freeze), eliminates disk paging (swappiness=0), zero C-state wakeup latency, and elevates GPU power limits.
.RE
.TP
.BR cgroup_isolation_enabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Enable cgroups v2 isolation moving non-gaming background processes (Discord, browsers, torrents) to housekeeping cores (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR vcache_pinning_enabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Enable AMD 3D V-Cache CCD core pinning via kernel 6.13+ \fBamd_x3d_vcache\fR driver or L3 cache cluster mapping (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR hybrid_pinning_enabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Pin game threads to Intel Performance (P) cores and isolate Efficient (E) cores (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR sysctl_tuning_enabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Enable dynamic kernel sysctl memory and scheduler adjustments (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR split_lock_mitigation_disabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Disable kernel split-lock mitigation (\fBkernel.split_lock_mitigate=0\fR) to prevent severe micro-stutters in older DirectX/Wine titles triggering unaligned atomic instructions (default: \fBtrue\fR in aggressive profile).
.TP
.BR thp_always_enabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Control Transparent HugePages mode (default: \fBfalse\fR; sets \fBmadvise\fR for safety).
.TP
.BR gpu_clock_lock_enabled " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Lock GPU compute and VRAM memory clocks to prevent downclock latency spikes during gameplay (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR realtime_process_priority " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Grant elevated priority (nice \-10 or SCHED_RR) to active gaming render loops (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR pipewire_quantum_tuning " = \fIBOOLEAN\fR"
Dynamically tune PipeWire audio buffer quantum during active gameplay (default: \fBtrue\fR).
.TP
.BR pipewire_latency_numerator " = \fIINTEGER\fR"
PipeWire buffer quantum numerator in samples (allowed: 16..8192, default: \fB64\fR).
.TP
.BR pipewire_latency_denominator " = \fIINTEGER\fR"
PipeWire audio sample rate denominator in Hz (allowed: 44100..192000, default: \fB48000\fR).
.TP
.BR swappiness " = \fIINTEGER\fR"
Kernel swappiness ratio (\fBvm.swappiness\fR) applied while gaming (allowed: 0..200, default: \fB10\fR).
.TP
.BR dirty_ratio " = \fIINTEGER\fR"
Percentage of system memory that can be dirty before background flushing starts (allowed: 1..90, default: \fB5\fR).
.TP
.BR compaction_proactiveness " = \fIINTEGER\fR"
Aggressiveness of proactive memory compaction (allowed: 0..100, default: \fB0\fR to prevent background memory stalls).
.TP
.BR poll_interval_ms " = \fIINTEGER\fR"
Fallback process scanning interval in milliseconds when Netlink events are unavailable (allowed: 50..10000, default: \fB500\fR).
